NAME
       free - display amount of free and used memory

SYNOPSIS
       free [-h|-b|-k|-m|-g]

DESCRIPTION
       Display total, used and free physical memory, with a usage bar on color
       terminals. Values are in KiB by default.

OPTIONS
       -h
           human readable units

       -b, -k, -m, -g
           bytes, KiB, MiB or GiB

EXAMPLES
       free -h

SEE ALSO
       df(1), ps(1)
